{"id": 286263, "field": "description", "en": "May the Holy Light protect us on our expedition to the frozen north.", "hash": "eee6c8a991b18f9f", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286264, "field": "name", "en": "Aegwynn's Silver Coin", "hash": "4083f8a19592a840", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286264, "field": "description", "en": "I really wish you mages would get your heads out from inside your own... books.", "hash": "2fdc6df9b9bc8eb6", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286265, "field": "name", "en": "Alleria's Silver Coin", "hash": "ea5b76b7333f252c", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286265, "field": "description", "en": "May my sisters realize their full potential, the name Windrunner known as result of their deeds.", "hash": "5658f716fd6c7fe5", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286266, "field": "name", "en": "Antonidas' Silver Coin", "hash": "031ddd80ad959aa1", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286266, "field": "description", "en": "Grant me the strength to accept the things that I cannot change, the courage to change the things I can, and the wisdom to know the difference.", "hash": "a430a55635d36e4e", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286267, "field": "name", "en": "Arcanist Doan's Silver Coin", "hash": "10877ab259f0165e", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286267, "field": "description", "en": "Oh, why won't you notice me? Abbendis, I would follow you anywhere. I wish you would notice me...", "hash": "54ac42ab785462a5", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286268, "field": "name", "en": "Fandral Staghelm's Silver Coin", "hash": "336e3e79c4f71cf3", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286268, "field": "description", "en": "I pray that when the time comes, I will have the strength to thwart the forces beyond the gate.", "hash": "06550e088aac82fe", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286269, "field": "name", "en": "Glowing Crystal Fragment", "hash": "e04f04dccdbdfe49", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286270, "field": "name", "en": "High Tinker Mekkatorque's Silver Coin", "hash": "f2449fe5ede6458f", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286270, "field": "description", "en": "How does this fountain even work? I wonder if I could make one.", "hash": "9e07f333729301e9", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286271, "field": "name", "en": "Khadgar's Silver Coin", "hash": "e6bd2f5a1bdb6c74", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286271, "field": "description", "en": "Turalyon and Alleria, wherever you are, may you be well.", "hash": "c8d073fa50918142", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286272, "field": "name", "en": "King Terenas Menethil's Silver Coin", "hash": "6cc0fcc0f79e09a9", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286272, "field": "description", "en": "May my son Arthas always act in the best interest of his people.", "hash": "dd75c0beee3c5a55", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286273, "field": "name", "en": "Maiev Shadowsong's Silver Coin", "hash": "5e0cc8c30e304ee8", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286273, "field": "description", "en": "Where's Illidan?", "hash": "f4f231cff78ee820", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286274, "field": "name", "en": "Medivh's Silver Coin", "hash": "4907cc7d7c851904", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286274, "field": "description", "en": "<You sense the ringing of three tones in your head, the third barely audible under the others' din.>", "hash": "9917df109c9b9a81", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286275, "field": "name", "en": "Prince Magni Bronzebeard's Silver Coin", "hash": "f503b2cb7630f874", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286275, "field": "description", "en": "I hope that my father and brothers outlive me. I'll not make much of a king.", "hash": "4da49bfd4561f246", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286279, "field": "name", "en": "Anduin Wrynn's Gold Coin", "hash": "fdf6ba5eb4043e6d", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286279, "field": "description", "en": "I wish I would grow up, it feels like I've been 10 for years.", "hash": "b991d8258215efdb", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286280, "field": "name", "en": "Uther Lightbringer's Gold Coin", "hash": "ae536535be08e008", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286280, "field": "description", "en": "Young Arthas must learn patience to temper his power. I will pray that he one day learns how to lead with care rather than force.", "hash": "bb389a87973a547d", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286281, "field": "name", "en": "Arthas' Gold Coin", "hash": "5bced5f6429a093c", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286281, "field": "description", "en": "Already, I've a kingdom in my prospects, a land to rule. What to ask for?  Perhaps a frozen scone...", "hash": "d1122935a69b8a25", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286283, "field": "name", "en": "Arugal's Gold Coin", "hash": "ac08a1e69b1ac5dc", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286283, "field": "description", "en": "I wish someday to retire to my own tidy little estate, with a bunch of pet dogs to keep me company.", "hash": "d20396c678437f2b", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286284, "field": "name", "en": "Brann Bronzebeard's Gold Coin", "hash": "e3b656618aa8bad2", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286284, "field": "description", "en": "Brann Bronzebeard was here.", "hash": "851089b6535fdc4c", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286287, "field": "name", "en": "Kel'Thuzad's Gold Coin", "hash": "b44e6106128a86ea", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286287, "field": "description", "en": "Sometimes... I wish someone would come along and just give me a big, long hug.", "hash": "c021960ffbaecdee", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286288, "field": "name", "en": "Lady Jaina Proudmoore's Gold Coin", "hash": "cd3ef2fce15ce4eb", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286288, "field": "description", "en": "Arthas, my love, please come back to me.", "hash": "75d29e0fb6cddf14", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286290, "field": "name", "en": "Lady Katrana Prestor's Gold Coin", "hash": "1903543c1ba5cc93", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286290, "field": "description", "en": "Listen, little wishing fountain. You'll give me all your power if you know what's good for you.", "hash": "dae8a1fb276c39bb", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286291, "field": "name", "en": "Sylvanas Windrunner's Gold Coin", "hash": "522bf858a22bb379", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286291, "field": "description", "en": "I hope my sisters and I can grow up and get married together. This coin appears to be very old.", "hash": "11a6603a7e594636", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286292, "field": "name", "en": "Tirion Fordring's Gold Coin", "hash": "efbd06609360e332", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286292, "field": "description", "en": "It is my wish that my dear Taelan will grow strong enough to defend the people he cares for.", "hash": "5c5303f2482714c6", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286293, "field": "name", "en": "Archimonde's Gold Coin", "hash": "6fda344381288619", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286293, "field": "description", "en": "I wish to know how you survived my wrath, little fountain.", "hash": "3846ac8d5b615cd5", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286294, "field": "name", "en": "Valdrus Blackthorne's Gold Coin", "hash": "babbdac979e6ad19", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286294, "field": "description", "en": "Explain my dreams, little fountain. Why must I always be viewing my kin from above and moving them like pawns?", "hash": "275f4627e9f9b55b", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286298, "field": "name", "en": "Umbrinoth's Gold Coin", "hash": "218f40f2d8e1d4cf", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286298, "field": "description", "en": "It seems my moonlighting days as a postal worker are coming to an end.", "hash": "7cf9401937ef68d9", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286299, "field": "name", "en": "Thrall's Gold Coin", "hash": "ebf430428ca40088", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286299, "field": "description", "en": "Grom, may you rest well, old friend.", "hash": "b8d72ae3dd8aa8be", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286300, "field": "name", "en": "Sonya Darkhallow's Gold Coin", "hash": "2bfc5c17c9def4e3", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286300, "field": "description", "en": "This doesn't make sense. Why am I putting a coin in a fountain?", "hash": "a022f59625801f14", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286302, "field": "name", "en": "Zarla Ober's Gold Coin", "hash": "1bc89155eebe5d7f", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286302, "field": "description", "en": "The amount of coins shining in the pool.. Maybe no one will notice if I take just one.", "hash": "5b57d231728415a0", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286304, "field": "name", "en": "A Footman's Copper Coin", "hash": "1804a0d60427db8e", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286304, "field": "description", "en": "Wish I had that cousin of mine's duty to do nothing more than lug wood around carelessly...", "hash": "f77f1f2f1efd1332", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286306, "field": "name", "en": "Vargoth's Copper Coin", "hash": "52d0b5cf87ebb542", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286306, "field": "description", "en": "I wish Captain Sanders would hurry up with my shipment of wine.", "hash": "3818476592a0c549", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286307, "field": "name", "en": "Ansirem's Copper Coin", "hash": "d27bd742f25a6884", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286307, "field": "description", "en": "I wish for happiness and acceptance for my daughter. She feels so out of place here...", "hash": "2dd811611b47b05e", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286308, "field": "name", "en": "Attumen's Copper Coin", "hash": "ca6f74aeaf90541c", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286308, "field": "description", "en": "Can I have a more comfortable saddle?  My hindquarters ache.", "hash": "c0d11bc5e72d193f", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286309, "field": "name", "en": "Danath's Copper Coin", "hash": "2d07f567eddb03a4", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286309, "field": "description", "en": "I hope a troll dies, right... NOW.", "hash": "5c88ac6d320f856a", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
