{"id": 286310, "field": "description", "en": "Being a rogue is hard work.  Someday I hope to pursue my life's one true passion...", "hash": "b0b1aeae61b1ab5d", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286311, "field": "name", "en": "Falstad Wildhammer's Copper Coin", "hash": "83123108b8fe38a9", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286311, "field": "description", "en": "I hope I end up in another book eventually.", "hash": "1e072bacf0956d4e", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286312, "field": "name", "en": "Inigo's Copper Coin", "hash": "a64742adb059b601", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286312, "field": "description", "en": "I wish I had my father back...", "hash": "b0bf1a4d4a96c1dc", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286313, "field": "name", "en": "Landro Longshot's Copper Coin", "hash": "35bc1e5ef1fa8c0e", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
{"id": 286313, "field": "description", "en": "I wish I'd kept that coin...", "hash": "fbe57df5137b1911", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70009"}
